WEBVTT

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:52.350
b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b-b e-s-take-in-b-b-b.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:53.490
closely!

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.020
coming right up bub.

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:05.380
The rich hotel, son, and step on it.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:18.580
Say, mister.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.780
I said the rich hotel, damn nabbit.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:04.700
Street driver.

00:04:30.988 --> 00:04:33.028
There's something fishy going on around here.

00:04:44.236 --> 00:04:46.136
No fair is getting away from me.

00:05:00.092 --> 00:05:02.992
You ain't eatin' no spinach in this picture!
